{"id":"n62353-5-5","stage":2,"title":"올려놓다 · 抬价","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62353-5-5-1","ko":"과일 값이 왜 이렇게 비싸요?","zh":"水果为什么这么贵啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"과일","meaning":"水果","explanation":"과일：水果","readings":[{"term":"과일","audio":"/audio/ed0e90733d1a21cf0b03.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18264","senseId":"1","lemma":"과일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"값이","meaning":"价格，价钱","explanation":"값：价格，价钱；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"값","audio":"/audio/b19ddf94b4c9896bb5c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20178","senseId":"1","lemma":"값","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"“이러하게(这样，这么)”的缩略语。","explanation":"이렇게：“이러하게(这样，这么)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71156","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비싸요?","meaning":"贵","explanation":"비싸다：贵；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"비싸다","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66318","senseId":"1","lemma":"비싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ed0e90733d1a21cf","term":"과일","zh":"水果","audio":"/audio/ed0e90733d1a21cf0b03.mp3","entryId":"18264","definition":"苹果、梨、葡萄、栗子等主要长在树上的，人们可以食用的果子。","pronunciation":["과ː일"]},{"id":"b19ddf94b4c9896b","term":"값","zh":"价格，价钱","audio":"/audio/b19ddf94b4c9896bb5c6.mp3","entryId":"20178","definition":"给买卖的东西划定的货币数量。","pronunciation":["갑"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"9a767a1c9118d82c","term":"이렇게","zh":"“이러하게(这样，这么)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3","entryId":"71156","definition":"“이러하게(这样，这么)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"063c1a7bb93233dc","term":"비싸다","zh":"贵","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3","entryId":"66318","definition":"物品的价格或做某事所花的费用高于一般水平。","pronunciation":["비싸다"]}],"audio":"/audio/043e7e547a3d461ab993.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62353-5-5-2","ko":"추석이라고 다들 가격을 올려놓아서 그렇지 뭐.","zh":"因为是中秋节，大家都把价格抬上去了呗。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"추석이라고","meaning":"中秋节","explanation":"추석：中秋节；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"추석","audio":"/audio/186bf2f255c7c8f2273c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69061","senseId":"1","lemma":"추석","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다들","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가격을","meaning":"价格，价钱","explanation":"가격：价格，价钱；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"가격","audio":"/audio/38c1b40757a204e578e9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62450","senseId":"1","lemma":"가격","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올려놓아서","meaning":"抬价","explanation":"올려놓다：抬价；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"올려놓다","audio":"/audio/d824a6970d16289c5aa8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62353","senseId":"5","lemma":"올려놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇지","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐.","meaning":"表示不用再多说什么，接受事实。","explanation":"뭐：表示不用再多说什么，接受事实。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27525","senseId":"3","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"186bf2f255c7c8f2","term":"추석","zh":"中秋节","audio":"/audio/186bf2f255c7c8f2273c.mp3","entryId":"69061","definition":"韩国的节日之一。农历8月15日，人们准备用新米做的松糕及当季水果进行祭祀。并且举行摔跤、拔河、圆圈舞等民俗游戏。","pronunciation":["추석"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"38c1b40757a204e5","term":"가격","zh":"价格，价钱","audio":"/audio/38c1b40757a204e578e9.mp3","entryId":"62450","definition":"用钱表示的物品的价值。","pronunciation":["가격"]},{"id":"d824a6970d16289c","term":"올려놓다","zh":"抬价","audio":"/audio/d824a6970d16289c5aa8.mp3","entryId":"62353","definition":"使价格变高。","pronunciation":["올려노타"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"表示不用再多说什么，接受事实。","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"27525","definition":"表示不用再多说什么，接受事实。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/802774491879fdd2b73a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.15,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62353","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"5","sourceLevel":"중급","day":69,"sequenceScore":1.8753,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["水果为什么这么贵啊？","因为是中秋节，大家都把价格抬上去了呗。","妈妈，这个叫什么名字呀？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["水果为什么这么贵啊？","因为是中秋节，大家都把价格抬上去了呗。","妈妈，这个叫什么名字呀？"],"answer":1}]}
